Role: Backend Software Engineer
Experience: 3–6 years
Location: Remote / Hybrid

Job Description:

We are looking for a Backend Software Engineer to design, develop, and maintain scalable backend services. The ideal candidate should have strong experience in Python-based backend development, REST APIs, databases, and cloud-native systems.

Key Responsibilities

Design and implement RESTful APIs using Python frameworks

Build scalable backend services and microservices

Work with SQL and NoSQL databases

Collaborate with frontend and DevOps teams

Write clean, maintainable, and testable code



Required Skills:

Strong proficiency in Python

Experience with FastAPI or Django

Knowledge of REST APIs

Experience with PostgreSQL / MySQL

Familiarity with Docker and basic cloud concepts

Git-based version control



Nice to Have

Experience with Redis, Celery

Exposure to AWS / GCP

CI/CD pipelines